nuScenes dataset

The nuScenes dataset, annotations, and expert prediction files are not
included. Obtain the dataset through the official nuScenes access process and
review the current terms at:

https://www.nuscenes.org/terms-of-use
https://www.nuscenes.org/nuscenes

The official Terms page currently names CC BY-SA 4.0 while linking to a
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 legal-code URL. The official dataset page separately describes
free dataset use as strictly non-commercial. Motional's additional Dataset
Terms state that they prevail in a conflict and also apply to data derived from
the dataset. This notice records but does not resolve those official wording
differences.

Users are responsible for determining whether their intended use,
redistribution, or publication of dataset-derived artifacts is permitted under
the terms applicable to them. Commercial or otherwise uncertain uses should be
clarified directly with Motional. R-GATE does not sublicense the dataset.

LightGBM, NumPy, and other runtime dependencies remain subject to their own
upstream terms. Their complete attribution and transitive dependency closure
remain a public-release gate.

